flowchart TD
    A[Ingestion completes successfully] --> B[Object appears in Objects catalog]
    B --> C[Open Objects at /objects]
    C --> D[Select an object]
    D --> E[Object detail at /objects/:objectId]

    E --> F{User role?}
    F -->|Viewer| G[View object only]
    F -->|Archiver or Admin| H[Select Edit]

    H --> I[Open editor at /objects/:objectId/edit]
    I --> J{Locked by another user?}

    J -->|Yes| K[Editor opens read-only]
    J -->|No| L[Acquire 60-minute edit lock]

    L --> M{What should be edited?}

    M -->|Metadata| N[Edit title, description, date, language, tags, people, rights notes]
    M -->|Document text| O[Open document pages]
    M -->|Audio or video transcript| P[Transcript editing not supported]

    O --> Q[View machine OCR]
    Q --> R[Edit curated text page by page]

    N --> S[Save draft]
    R --> S

    S --> T{Revision still current?}
    T -->|No| U[409 revision conflict]
    U --> V[Reload authoritative object and preserve local edits]
    V --> S

    T -->|Yes| W[Draft saved locally]
    W --> X[Submit changes]

    X --> Y[Backend packages saved revision:
    metadata, rights and access policy, curated OCR]
    Y --> Z[Immutable submission recorded;
    object_revision_apply queued for archive worker]

    Z --> AA{Submission status?}
    AA -->|PENDING or PROCESSING| AB[UI polls /changes/status;
    Submit button shows queued state]
    AB --> AA

    AA -->|COMPLETED| AC[Revision applied to archive]
    AC --> AD[Editor shows synchronized state]

    AA -->|FAILED or CANCELED| AE[UI surfaces failure reason]
    AE --> AF[Retry synchronization via retry endpoint]
    AF --> AA

    W --> AG[Users may keep editing:
    save revision N+1 while N synchronizes]
    AG --> S
